      "width": 835,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "• Was the leak truly accidental or a controlled release? (Anthropic's response was measured, not panicked)\n• How much competitive advantage did OpenAI/Google gain? (Cursor already had similar patterns)\n• Ethics of reimplementing leaked code — clean-room defense holds legally, but what about ethically?\n• Will Anthropic adopt community fixes (cc-cache-fix) or rebuild independently?",
